# Anti-Slop Webcraft - Cursor Routing & Operational Rules
# Architecture: Museum-Grade Frontend Systems & Anti-Generic Aesthetics
# Target Environments: Next.js (App Router), React 19, Three.js / R3F, GSAP, Tailwind CSS v4

# Root Invariants
- ALWAYS inspect corresponding module in `.skills/` before proposing frontend implementations.
- NEVER introduce generic AI palettes (#6366f1, purple-to-blue gradients, warm cream + forest green + serif).
- NEVER use unicode emojis in code, logs, comments, or UI. Use `@phosphor-icons/react` with stroke-width 1.5 or raw SVGs.
- ALWAYS adhere to the OKLCH 60-30-10 color balance engine with 1px hairline inner specular highlights.
- ALWAYS use physical spring models over arbitrary ease curves (stiffness: 200, damping: 25).
- ALWAYS force GPU composition on animated elements (transform: translateZ(0), will-change: transform).

